<title>UK: Hamburgische LB sets 20 bln yen Dec 2025 bond.</title>
<headline>Hamburgische LB sets 20 bln yen Dec 2025 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following reverse dual currency bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HAMBURGISCHE LANDESBANK</p>
<p> AMT    20 BLN YEN    COUPON     **	  MATURITY    11.DEC.25</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.50    PAY DATE    11.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  50 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES     **ISSUER HAS OPTION TO PAY A COUPON OF EITHER</p>
<p>		 5.73 PCT IN MARKS, 6.07 PCT IN  AUSTRALIAN DOLLARS</p>
<p>		 5.73 PCT IN U.S DOLLARS.</p>
<p>		 REDEMPTION IS IN YEN.</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (M)  100	GOV LAW     UK</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP/GE  NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
